---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../consts';
---
<BaseLayout title="Disclaimer">
  <article class="article">
    <h1>Disclaimer</h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <p><em>Last updated: please edit this date when you review this page.</em></p>

      <h2>Presumption of innocence</h2>
      <p>
        Many reports on {SITE.name} concern allegations, complaints, ongoing
        investigations or pending court cases. An allegation, FIR, charge or
        investigation is <strong>not</strong> a finding of guilt. Every person
        is presumed innocent unless and until convicted by a competent court.
      </p>

      <h2>Sources and accuracy</h2>
      <p>
        Our reports are compiled from publicly available records and published
        reports, which are linked within each article. While we make reasonable
        efforts to ensure accuracy, we do not independently guarantee the
        contents of third-party sources. Information may change as cases progress.
      </p>

      <h2>Opinion vs. fact</h2>
      <p>
        Any analysis or commentary represents the author's honest opinion based
        on the stated facts and is not presented as a statement of fact.
      </p>

      <h2>Corrections and right of reply</h2>
      <p>
        We are committed to fairness. If you are the subject of a report or
        believe content is inaccurate, contact us via the
        <a href="/contact">Contact</a> page. We will review promptly, publish a
        correction where warranted, and offer a right of reply.
      </p>

      <h2>No legal advice</h2>
      <p>
        Nothing on this site is legal advice. This page is a general notice and
        not a substitute for advice from a qualified lawyer. You should have a
        lawyer review your specific situation before relying on it.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
